 WHERE slug = 'beautiful-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description = $x$Beautiful.ai is a web-based presentation tool whose slides auto-format as you add content, with a March 2026 update introducing a context-aware AI workflow for conversational deck creation. It is a paid product with a 14-day free trial and no permanent free plan.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'beautiful-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$Beautiful.ai is a web-based presentation app built around "smart slides" that automatically adjust layout, spacing and alignment as you add content, so decks stay tidy without manual fiddling. It has always leaned toward design automation rather than freehand slide editing.

On March 18, 2026 the company announced a context-aware AI workflow along with a $45M investment from General Catalyst. The press release does not use the names "3.0" or "Create with AI"; it describes the update as reframing slide creation around conversational, context-aware AI assistance.

The update lets users describe what they want and refine decks through iterative chat, with AI image generation and AI-assisted theme selection. It also added UI localization in 15 languages, a new public API, a ChatGPT app, and a more mobile-friendly experience; the pricing page separately advertises that Team-plan users can create presentations in 100+ languages.

Pricing starts with Pro at $14.50/month billed annually; there is also a monthly-billed option, marketed as a "Single Presentation" plan at $45/month, which includes everything in Pro. Team plans (2-20 users) run $40/user/month billed annually or $50/user/month billed monthly. Enterprise pricing for 20+ users is custom. Beautiful.ai also offers a flat-rate SMB plan, though exact figures are not published on the vendor's pricing or SMB pages. Students get one year free with a valid .edu email.

There is no permanent free plan: beyond the 14-day free trial of Pro or Team (credit card required, auto-charged unless cancelled) and the one-year education offer, access requires payment. Annual plans are only partially refundable within 24 hours, and monthly plans are non-refundable. The design-automation model also means less pixel-level control than PowerPoint or Google Slides.

It fits professionals and teams who want good-looking, on-brand decks quickly and are comfortable trading fine-grained manual control for speed and consistency, especially those who will use the AI generation and template automation and can commit to a paid plan.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'beautiful-ai' AND lang = 'en';

