UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"q": "Is Suno or Udio better?", "a": "Suno and Udio are both AI music generators. A direct quality or usability comparison is subjective, and we could not verify specific claims about Udio from Suno's own sources."}, {"q": "Is Suno free?", "a": "Suno offers a free plan with 50 credits per day, for personal non-commercial use, though free accounts do not get regular monthly downloads. Pro is $10 per month ($8 per month if billed annually) and Premier is $30 per month ($24 per month if billed annually), for more credits, monthly downloads and commercial use rights."}, {"q": "Can I sell music made with Suno?", "a": "Yes, on Pro and Premier plans, Suno grants commercial use rights, though monthly downloads are capped at 20 on Pro and 60 on Premier (unlimited inside Suno Studio). The free plan does not allow commercial use. Suno is also currently facing a copyright lawsuit, with a US judge denying its motion to dismiss in September 2026, so licensing terms may continue to evolve."}, {"q": "What is Udio AI?", "a": "Udio is a separate AI music generation tool from another company. We could not verify further details about it from Suno's own sources."}]$x$::jsonb
