UPDATE tools SET description = $x$Runway is a multi-model generative platform for image, video, and audio. Its current flagship is Gen-4.5, announced December 1, 2025, which ranked No. 1 on the Artificial Analysis Video Arena leaderboard and is available on all paid plans.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'runway' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$Runway is a web-based generative media platform built around text-to-video and image-to-video, but it has grown well beyond a simple editor. Today it also handles image generation and native audio, and it hosts a range of third-party models alongside its own.

The current flagship is Gen-4.5, announced on December 1, 2025. It sits at the top of the Gen-4 family, which also includes Gen-4 and the faster Gen-4 Turbo. Compared with earlier Gen-4 models, Gen-4.5 improves motion quality, prompt adherence, and physical and temporal realism, and the family added native audio generation alongside video. At launch it took the No. 1 spot on the Artificial Analysis Video Arena leaderboard.

Beyond its own models, Runway lets you work with external ones such as Nano Banana Pro, Kling, Seedance, Seed Audio, and Lyria, so you can compare outputs without leaving the platform. That makes it useful for character consistency across shots, image-driven video, and mixed image, video, and audio workflows.

Pricing is credit-based. The Free plan costs nothing and gives 125 one-time credits with a limited selection of generative models and 5GB of storage. Standard is $12/mo billed annually ($15 monthly) with 625 credits a month. Pro is $28/mo annually ($35 monthly) with 2,250 credits. Max is $76/mo annually ($95 monthly) with 9,500 credits and one-month rollover. Runway also offers a Team plan with shared credits, introduced in 2026, though its price is not published on the pricing page, and a custom Enterprise plan.

The main limitation is the credit system: generation consumes credits, so heavy use gets expensive, and the free tier's one-time credit allotment is more of a trial than a working plan. Pricing for the Team tier is not disclosed, so teams need to contact sales for a quote.

Runway suits creators, editors, and studios who want a single place to generate and compare AI video across multiple models, and who are comfortable paying per credit for higher-quality output.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'runway' AND lang = 'en';

