UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"q": "Is Canva AI free?", "a": "Canva offers a free plan with limited AI features. Paid Pro, Business, and Enterprise plans unlock more AI tools such as Dream Lab image generation and Magic Write, but exact pricing is region-dependent and not published as a single USD figure."}, {"q": "What AI features does Figma have?", "a": "Figma AI (launched 2024) includes AI-generated layers and designs from text prompts, AI rename for layers, first draft generation, and prototype generation. It's built into Figma and available to all paid plan users."}, {"q": "Can Canva replace Figma?", "a": "No. Canva and Figma serve different purposes. Canva is for creating marketing content and presentations. Figma is for designing UI/UX interfaces and product prototypes. Designers use Figma; content creators use Canva."}, {"q": "Which is better for beginners — Canva or Figma?", "a": "Canva is significantly easier for beginners — it's designed for non-designers with drag-and-drop simplicity. Figma has a steeper learning curve and is designed for professional designers. For quick graphics, start with Canva."}]$x$::jsonb
