UPDATE tools SET description = $x$HeyGen is an AI video platform for creating avatar-driven videos, voice cloning and translation. Its current flagship model, Avatar V, builds a lifelike digital twin from a 15-second recording.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'heygen' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$HeyGen is a browser-based platform for producing videos that are presented by AI avatars. You type or paste a script, pick or create an avatar, choose a voice, and the system generates a talking-head video without a camera crew or studio.

The current flagship is Avatar V, announced in April 2026, the most realistic avatar model HeyGen offers. It is created from a single 15-second recording and adds full upper-body motion, multi-angle consistency and long-form identity stability, so the same avatar stays believable across longer scripts. Multi-look generation lets you change outfit or background while preserving the original movement. HeyGen has also integrated Seedance 2.0 for more cinematic AI video generation, and language coverage has grown to 175+ on paid plans (30+ on the free plan).

Beyond avatars, the core toolkit covers voice cloning, video translation with lip-sync, a library of 500+ stock avatars, and an API for programmatic generation.

Pricing runs on a credit system across five tiers. Free is $0/month (3 videos/month, up to 1 minute each, 1080p, 1 custom avatar, 30+ languages). Creator is $29/month ($24/month billed annually) with 600 credits/month, videos up to 30 minutes, 1080p, voice cloning and 175+ languages. Pro is $49/month with 1,000 credits/month, videos up to 30 minutes and 4K output. Business is $149/month plus $20 per additional seat, with 1,500 credits/month, videos up to 60 minutes, 5+ custom avatars, SSO/SAML and LMS integrations. Enterprise pricing is custom.

The main limitation is the credit system itself: how fast credits are consumed varies by avatar model and feature, so real monthly cost is harder to predict than a flat per-video price, and heavier users on lower tiers can run out of allowance before the month ends.

HeyGen suits marketers, training teams, localization teams and creators who need frequent talking-head video without filming, and who can work within a credit budget.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'heygen' AND lang = 'en';

