UPDATE tools SET description = $x$Character.AI is a conversational platform for chatting with user-created AI characters, running on its PipSqueak 3 default chat style alongside free ShortSqueak and premium DeepSqueak/LongSqueak options as of September 2026.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'character-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$Character.AI is a chat platform built around AI personas: you talk to thousands of user-made characters, from fictional figures to helpers and companions, or build your own. It has long been one of the most-used consumer chat apps outside the big general-purpose assistants.

As of September 28, 2026, the platform's default chat style is PipSqueak 3, with ShortSqueak available on the free tier and DeepSqueak and LongSqueak reserved for paid plans. The company has also been repositioning around image models for characters and messaging itself as an entertainment and fandom platform. A previously announced DeepSqueak 2 model has not been confirmed as released.

Core capabilities include multi-turn roleplay and storytelling, custom character creation with personas and voices, voice calls, and tools for generating videos, stories and streams.

Pricing is freemium. The free plan offers unlimited messaging on PipSqueak 3 and ShortSqueak but shows ads. A new (c.ai) lite tier, introduced September 28, 2026, costs $4.99 per month or $2.49 per week (price may vary by region) and adds a daily allowance of premium messages on DeepSqueak and LongSqueak, fewer ads, a less restrictive slow mode, extra customization and more memory pins. A higher c.ai+ tier promises unlimited premium chats, zero ads and full memory features, but its price could not be confirmed on a primary source as of this writing.

The biggest limitation is a policy shift effective November 25, 2025: users under 18 can no longer do open-ended chat or roleplay and are redirected to creating videos, stories and streams, with age assurance handled through the company's own in-house age-estimation tools. This followed lawsuits and regulatory pressure. The exact cost of the top c.ai+ tier remains unverified, and the model lineup has changed multiple times in 2026.

It suits adults who want character-driven chat and roleplay, and creators building interactive personas and stories. Those who don't mind ads can use it for free, while budget-conscious users can get daily access to the better models for $4.99/month via (c.ai) lite. Minors and users wanting an unrestricted free experience should look elsewhere.$x$
